{"id": "ledgar/test/3381", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"The Administrator may, from time to time, select from among all Eligible Individuals, those to whom an Award shall be granted and shall determine the nature and amount of each Award, which shall not be inconsistent with the requirements of the Plan. Except for any Non-Employee Director’s right to Awards that may be required pursuant to the Non-Employee Director Equity Compensation Policy as described in Section 4.6, no Eligible Individual or other Person shall have any right to be granted an Award pursuant to the Plan and neither the Company nor the Administrator is obligated to treat Eligible Individuals, Holders or any other persons uniformly. Participation by each Holder in the Plan shall be voluntary and nothing in the Plan or any Program shall be construed as mandating that any Eligible Individual or other Person shall participate in the Plan.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Defined Terms\": null, \"Definitions\": null, \"Disability\": null, \"Disclosures\": null, \"Duties\": null, \"Effective Dates\": null, \"Effectiveness\": null, \"Employment\": null, \"Enforceability\": null, \"Enforcements\": null, \"Enti